--- Sentence//end
id: 397
r#  71299  1330  66
p: .
t. 
|  Given this conceptual background, I will adopt the
|  phrase <!!"!!>staging order<!!"!!> as a linguistic
.  counterpart to computational <!!"!!>push/transfer<!!"!!> order

