.   @l() -82220/1548/47
p: .
t. 
|   Verbs have implicit
|  <!!"!!>slots<!!"!!> for such variegated thematic roles, and by observing
|  the particular slot slated for a given word (via theta formations)
|  or phrases (via case-marking; particularly, in English, leading
|  prepositions) we identify
.  the intended role for the constituent [/LucasChampollion/]


