r#  88553  1664  18
p: .
t. 
|  In cognition, meanwhile, the line between
|  predicative belief and practical know-how is more
.  radically blurred


--- Sentence/switch
id: 491
r#  88554  1664  19


--- Sentence//end
id: 491
r#  88682  1666  37
p: .
t. 
|   For one thing, facts are not isolated data-points;
|  they are inextricably contextualized
.  by conceptual and pragmatic networks


--- Sentence/switch
id: 492
r#  88683  1666  38


--- Sentence//end
id: 492
r#  88827  1668  24
p: .
t. 
|   For another, facts and enactive maxims
|  share agent and theme/role structures, on a vaguely <!!"!!>Neo-Davidsonian<!!"!!> event
.  semantics [/HarryBunt/]


--- Sentence/switch
