r#  92476  1737  44


--- Sentence//end
id: 511
r#  92655  1741  11
p: .
t. 
|  Conventions in grammar acquire rule-like status
|  in light of processing demands for aligning <!!"!!>staging<!!"!!>
|  word-order to optimal cognitive construal of conceptual
.  aggregates


--- Sentence/switch
id: 512
r#  92656  1741  12


--- Sentence//end
id: 512
r#  92865  1744  57
p: .
t. 
|   So such word-order is not just a feature
|  of syntax; it is a causative foundation for
|  syntax (see likewise [/GerdesKahane;pp. 4--9, 12-13/],
.  if one accepts a cognitive reading of <!!"!!>fragmentation<!!"!!>)

